            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>What are the effects of expanding urban residential systems on the constituting parts of these systems, both in a qualitative and in a quantitative way. The migration areas of both Randstad wings, North ( P0870a ) and South ( P0870b ), are compared with each other. Attention is focused on spatial wave models as the context for a description of the effects of migration.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
